      <pattern name="Record memory service" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/Memory/MatterMemoryService.cs">Generalized record memory (task 050) captures the precursor items.</pattern>
      <pattern name="Widget render surface" location="src/client/shared/Spaarke.AI.Widgets/">OutcomeCard component render for chips (SpaarkeAi consumer).</pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <context>
    <background>D-M4 explicitly scopes workspace intelligence to PRECURSORS in r2 — the two seams (chips + record memory) that a later goal-tracking subsystem would consume. Building the subsystem now is out of scope (named deferral); this task ships just enough for the direction to be real.</background>
    <dependencies>
