    <step order="2" name="Record-scope precursor memory">Capture record-scope memory items through the generalized service + envelope.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Tests">Chips sourced from declared transitions (not invented); record precursor item persisted. Include NEGATIVE below.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Verify + governance">Build; run tests; measure publish-size; state Placement Justification.</step>
